    "### Now let's add events to memory\n",
    "\n",
    "Note that arguments to create an event are the memory ID (the ID of the AgentCore memory provider), the actor ID, a session ID, and a payload.\n",
    "\n",
    "Below we provide example actor ID and session ID functions but you can use method you like."
